00:24:42,520 --> 00:24:43,600
When you walked this way,

892
00:24:43,600 --> 00:24:44,320
my heart just

893
00:24:45,280 --> 00:24:46,120
started pounding.

894
00:24:47,120 --> 00:24:47,960
Okay, come on.

895
00:24:57,200 --> 00:24:59,360
Hello.

896
00:25:05,040 --> 00:25:05,960
Yu Yang.

897
00:25:10,320 --> 00:25:11,120
Okay.

898
00:25:24,480 --> 00:25:25,040
We both like places

899
00:25:25,040 --> 00:25:26,200
where there's no one around.

900
00:25:26,680 --> 00:25:27,200
Yeah.

901
00:25:31,440 --> 00:25:31,840
Okay.

902
00:25:31,840 --> 00:25:32,800
Good.

903
00:25:36,140 --> 00:25:39,940
(Going out to get some water)

904
00:25:41,560 --> 00:25:42,800
What a coincidence.

905
00:25:50,460 --> 00:25:51,620
(Polaroid)

906
00:25:51,640 --> 00:25:53,080
Let me show you again.

907
00:25:53,640 --> 00:25:54,880
I've never sat on this before.

908
00:25:54,880 --> 00:25:56,500
(Takes it)

909
00:25:57,900 --> 00:25:58,980
(Looking closely)

910
00:25:59,120 --> 00:26:00,560
Here's a spoon for you.

911
00:26:01,830 --> 00:26:03,960
Three, two, one.

912
00:26:05,560 --> 00:26:07,240
So cute.

913
00:26:07,240 --> 00:26:08,640
You look so tiny in this.

914
00:26:09,240 --> 00:26:10,560
Tiny as in age?

915
00:26:11,000 --> 00:26:11,880
Or my looks?

916
00:26:12,200 --> 00:26:13,640
Or my size?

917
00:26:13,640 --> 00:26:14,440
Your size.

918
00:26:15,600 --> 00:26:16,440
Okay.

919
00:26:16,440 --> 00:26:17,980
(Thinking it over)

920
00:26:18,440 --> 00:26:19,680
I really need to wear more sunscreen.

921
00:26:19,680 --> 00:26:20,800
If I get any tanner,

922
00:26:20,800 --> 00:26:21,800
you won't even be able to see me.

923
00:26:21,800 --> 00:26:23,040
Let me see.

924
00:26:23,040 --> 00:26:23,760
I can still see you.

925
00:26:25,320 --> 00:26:27,120
The lighting was pretty dark.

926
00:26:28,120 --> 00:26:29,880
It's okay. There'll be more chances.

927
00:26:33,520 --> 00:26:34,960
But I think this one looks great.

928
00:26:37,040 --> 00:26:39,200
(Cui Kaiyi)
Is this the magic of Polaroids?

929
00:26:39,800 --> 00:26:40,960
I can see why.

930
00:26:41,560 --> 00:26:42,880
Now I want to get one too.

931
00:26:46,460 --> 00:26:48,220
(Cao Yiheng)

932
00:26:48,240 --> 00:26:50,920
(Following with his eyes)
He's been keeping an eye on her.

933
00:26:55,000 --> 00:26:56,880
(Teasing)
You're all bundled up today.

934
00:26:59,960 --> 00:27:01,840
I'll give you my jacket.

935
00:27:02,920 --> 00:27:04,640
It's okay. I'll just use this pillow.

936
00:27:05,820 --> 00:27:06,980
(Takes off jacket)

937
00:27:07,040 --> 00:27:07,640
Here.

938
00:27:08,620 --> 00:27:09,860
(Takes it)

939
00:27:09,880 --> 00:27:10,720
That's so sweet.

940
00:27:20,080 --> 00:27:22,000
What other holiday can we celebrate

941
00:27:22,000 --> 00:27:22,680
this month?

942
00:27:24,160 --> 00:27:25,680
You want to celebrate every day, huh?

943
00:27:26,800 --> 00:27:28,400
You just want to get gifts every day.

944
00:27:28,660 --> 00:27:30,060
(Laughs)

945
00:27:31,560 --> 00:27:32,480
He wants to celebrate

946
00:27:32,480 --> 00:27:33,520
every day with you.

947
00:27:36,720 --> 00:27:37,880
Are they rowing?

948
00:27:37,880 --> 00:27:38,680
Let's go take a look.

949
00:27:39,520 --> 00:27:41,040
Let's see how they row.

950
00:27:41,040 --> 00:27:42,120
I'm so curious.

951
00:27:43,160 --> 00:27:44,040
I can't see them.

952
00:27:44,040 --> 00:27:45,120
They must've rowed pretty far.

953
00:27:46,160 --> 00:27:47,480
Can they go that far?

954
00:27:48,160 --> 00:27:48,880
Look over there.

955
00:27:48,880 --> 00:27:49,240
Is that them?

956
00:27:49,240 --> 00:27:50,000
I can't see clearly.

957
00:27:52,120 --> 00:27:53,840
They're pretty far out.

958
00:27:56,480 --> 00:27:57,840
Maybe we can go for a ride

959
00:27:57,840 --> 00:27:59,960
when you're wearing something warmer.

960
00:27:59,960 --> 00:28:00,520
Go rowing?

961
00:28:00,520 --> 00:28:01,120
Sure.

962
00:28:03,160 --> 00:28:04,480
Won't we tip over?

963
00:28:05,080 --> 00:28:06,000
I feel like I'm really...

964
00:28:06,000 --> 00:28:06,560
Then we're screwed.

965
00:28:06,560 --> 00:28:07,680
My balance isn't that great.

966
00:28:07,680 --> 00:28:08,720
If we tip over, we're screwed.

967
00:28:13,640 --> 00:28:15,440
I just remembered that day.

968
00:28:15,440 --> 00:28:16,720
Didn't I tell you I was going to

969
00:28:16,720 --> 00:28:18,160
go chat with Sun Bohan?

970
00:28:24,000 --> 00:28:25,040
Then when I came back,

971
00:28:25,040 --> 00:28:25,920
I didn't see you.

972
00:28:27,580 --> 00:28:30,740
(Shy)

973
00:28:31,800 --> 00:28:32,800
I went back to my room.

974
00:28:32,800 --> 00:28:33,320
Yeah.

975
00:28:33,320 --> 00:28:34,760
To "recover".

976
00:28:36,160 --> 00:28:37,320
He's teasing her.

977
00:28:37,320 --> 00:28:38,640
I was worried

978
00:28:38,640 --> 00:28:39,200
you might

979
00:28:39,200 --> 00:28:40,360
be upset.

980
00:28:42,540 --> 00:28:43,780
(Observing)

981
00:28:43,800 --> 00:28:45,160
Am I really that petty?

982
00:28:51,960 --> 00:28:53,120
They're so sweet together.

983
00:28:55,980 --> 00:28:57,100
(Taking in the sweetness)

984
00:28:57,840 --> 00:28:58,800
I'm loving this.

985
00:29:06,760 --> 00:29:07,280
Let's go upstairs.

986
00:29:07,600 --> 00:29:07,960
Let's go.

987
00:29:08,340 --> 00:29:09,800
(Chen Hewen and Sha Yue'er
return to Signal House)

988
00:29:09,800 --> 00:29:11,520
Bring your little star.

989
00:29:13,440 --> 00:29:14,120
Let's go upstairs first.

990
00:29:14,120 --> 00:29:14,520
Okay.

991
00:29:15,480 --> 00:29:16,440
You've been wearing heels for so long.

992
00:29:16,440 --> 00:29:17,480
I don't want you walking anymore.

993
00:29:17,480 --> 00:29:18,440
Thank you.

994
00:29:19,840 --> 00:29:20,840
Hi, guys.

995
00:29:21,800 --> 00:29:22,440
Hi.

996
00:29:22,440 --> 00:29:23,360
Hello.

997
00:29:26,860 --> 00:29:28,700
(Looks up)

998
00:29:29,620 --> 00:29:30,140
(Bumps into something)

999
00:29:32,680 --> 00:29:34,680
The two people everyone
has been watching.

1000
00:29:38,760 --> 00:29:40,360
You look beautiful today.

1001
00:29:40,360 --> 00:29:41,360
Really?

1002
00:29:41,360 --> 00:29:42,840
Yeah. Your hair...

1003
00:29:42,840 --> 00:29:43,880
Your new hairstyle.

1004
00:29:43,880 --> 00:29:44,920
Look at the back.

1005
00:29:45,600 --> 00:29:47,080
So pretty.

1006
00:29:48,280 --> 00:29:49,480
I had to show it to you, Cui Kaiyi.

1007
00:29:49,620 --> 00:29:52,020
(Photo of the two
from their stargazing date)

1008
00:29:52,640 --> 00:29:53,880
Let me see first.

1009
00:29:53,880 --> 00:29:54,960
Let me see.

1010
00:29:56,920 --> 00:29:58,000
What's that?

1011
00:29:58,440 --> 00:29:59,120
What is that?

1012
00:30:01,080 --> 00:30:01,600
Take a look.

1013
00:30:01,600 --> 00:30:02,400
Let us take a look.

1014
00:30:02,400 --> 00:30:03,520
Maybe it's just my face.

1015
00:30:03,520 --> 00:30:04,680
We didn't get the angle right at first.

1016
00:30:04,680 --> 00:30:06,080
I wasn't looking at you, okay?

1017
00:30:07,640 --> 00:30:08,920
Okay.

1018
00:30:08,920 --> 00:30:10,520
I'll look at you.

1019
00:30:13,440 --> 00:30:15,400
We didn't see many stars tonight.

1020
00:30:15,400 --> 00:30:16,640
Because of the weather.

1021
00:30:16,960 --> 00:30:17,840
But we did have the moon.

1022
00:30:17,840 --> 00:30:18,560
That moon

1023
00:30:18,560 --> 00:30:19,520
was brighter and rounder

1024
00:30:19,520 --> 00:30:20,320
than ever before.

1025
00:30:20,320 --> 00:30:21,000
Yeah.

1026
00:30:21,000 --> 00:30:22,280
It lines up.

1027
00:30:22,680 --> 00:30:23,440
It matches up.

1028
00:30:24,320 --> 00:30:25,800
He didn't mean it,
but they read into it.

1029
00:30:25,800 --> 00:30:26,440
Yeah.

1030
00:30:26,440 --> 00:30:27,200
That moon

1031
00:30:27,200 --> 00:30:28,120
was brighter and rounder

1032
00:30:28,120 --> 00:30:28,960
than ever before.

1033
00:30:28,960 --> 00:30:29,640
Yeah.

1034
00:30:30,260 --> 00:30:32,340
(Looking down)

1035
00:30:32,360 --> 00:30:33,800
Some hearts rejoice, while others ache.

1036
00:30:38,240 --> 00:30:38,840
Come on.

1037
00:30:38,840 --> 00:30:39,600
They're taking pictures.

1038
00:30:41,000 --> 00:30:41,600
Should we go up first?

1039
00:30:41,600 --> 00:30:42,440
Let's...

1040
00:30:42,440 --> 00:30:42,880
Let's go up first.

1041
00:30:43,760 --> 00:30:44,840
They're taking pictures now.

1042
00:30:47,600 --> 00:30:48,160
Do you want to take a picture?

1043
00:30:48,160 --> 00:30:49,080
Do you want...

1044
00:30:49,080 --> 00:30:49,840
I'll be right down.

1045
00:30:49,840 --> 00:30:50,360
Coming right down.

1046
00:30:55,560 --> 00:30:56,480
What's going on?

1047
00:30:57,120 --> 00:30:58,280
What are you trying to ship?

1048
00:30:59,400 --> 00:31:00,800
Do you want me to explain?

1049
00:31:01,480 --> 00:31:03,320
Everyone take a tulip.

1050
00:31:03,600 --> 00:31:04,600
Thank you.

1051
00:31:04,600 --> 00:31:05,160
Thanks.

1052
00:31:05,160 --> 00:31:06,200
I'll put it in a vase.

1053
00:31:06,200 --> 00:31:07,240
I'll keep it alive.

1054
00:31:12,960 --> 00:31:13,640
Wait.

1055
00:31:13,640 --> 00:31:14,360
Why are you walking so fast?

1056
00:31:17,540 --> 00:31:19,620
(Flowers for Sha Yue'er)
And there's a gift.

1057
00:31:20,240 --> 00:31:21,320
These flowers are for you.

1058
00:31:23,040 --> 00:31:23,360
Sorry.

1059
00:31:23,360 --> 00:31:23,800
I'm sorry.

1060
00:31:24,880 --> 00:31:25,680
Sorry.

1061
00:31:26,640 --> 00:31:27,640
You like blue.

1062
00:31:27,640 --> 00:31:28,360
I picked this out myself.

1063
00:31:28,360 --> 00:31:29,520
(Sha Yue'er's favorite color)
It's so pretty.

1064
00:31:29,520 --> 00:31:30,120
And there's more.

1065
00:31:30,880 --> 00:31:31,640
This one is more fitting

1066
00:31:31,640 --> 00:31:32,800
for Children's Day.

1067
00:31:32,800 --> 00:31:33,320
You can display it.

1068
00:31:33,320 --> 00:31:34,400
It's candy-shaped.

1069
00:31:34,400 --> 00:31:35,280
They're all blue.

1070
00:31:35,480 --> 00:31:36,920
So pretty.

1071
00:31:38,160 --> 00:31:39,760
You have such exquisite taste.

1072
00:31:40,440 --> 00:31:41,800
(Smiles)
Thank you.

1073
00:31:41,800 --> 00:31:42,440
I'm glad you like it.

1074
00:31:42,440 --> 00:31:43,240
So happy.

1075
00:31:43,240 --> 00:31:44,160
She's happy today.

1076
00:31:44,160 --> 00:31:44,520
Just leave it here.

1077
00:31:44,520 --> 00:31:44,920
I think that'll work.

1078
00:31:44,920 --> 00:31:45,720
It'd be nice for the room

1079
00:31:45,720 --> 00:31:46,760
to have a little floral scent.

1080
00:31:46,760 --> 00:31:47,920
Thank you.

1081
00:31:48,160 --> 00:31:49,240
It's so pretty.

1082
00:31:49,640 --> 00:31:50,440
Really?

1083
00:31:50,440 --> 00:31:51,320
I love it.

1084
00:31:51,920 --> 00:31:53,640
Didn't we see

1085
00:31:53,640 --> 00:31:54,680
Cao Yiheng and Cui Kaiyi yesterday?

1086
00:31:54,680 --> 00:31:55,480
When they walked by, you said,

1087
00:31:55,480 --> 00:31:55,960
"I want flowers too."

1088
00:31:56,240 --> 00:31:57,120
Yeah.

1089
00:31:58,320 --> 00:31:59,120
Hi, guys.

1090
00:31:59,120 --> 00:32:00,520
(The night before)

1091
00:32:00,520 --> 00:32:01,600
So romantic.

1092
00:32:01,600 --> 00:32:03,000
Keep going.

1093
00:32:03,520 --> 00:32:04,920
I like flowers too.

1094
00:32:05,140 --> 00:32:06,900
(Memorizing it quietly)

1095
00:32:07,160 --> 00:32:07,920
He remembers everything.

1096
00:32:10,480 --> 00:32:11,720
Well,

1097
00:32:11,720 --> 00:32:13,080
you're pretty thoughtful.

1098
00:32:13,480 --> 00:32:15,040
If you want flowers,

1099
00:32:15,040 --> 00:32:15,960
I'll definitely get you some.

1100
00:32:16,400 --> 00:32:17,600
Thank you.

1101
00:32:17,600 --> 00:32:18,720
Bye. Talk to you tomorrow.

1102
00:32:18,720 --> 00:32:19,360
See you tomorrow.

1103
00:32:25,220 --> 00:32:27,740
(Laughs)

1104
00:32:29,160 --> 00:32:30,240
That smile.

1105
00:32:30,240 --> 00:32:31,560
That's a good sign.

1106
00:32:32,200 --> 00:32:33,440
These flowers are nice.

1107
00:32:34,800 --> 00:32:35,600
I think the "moon"

1108
00:32:35,600 --> 00:32:36,520
is full now.

1109
00:32:37,560 --> 00:32:37,960
Right?

1110
00:32:40,800 --> 00:32:41,680
Just now,

1111
00:32:41,680 --> 00:32:43,160
seeing the "moon" and "star" together

1112
00:32:43,160 --> 00:32:44,240
was a little awkward.

1113
00:32:51,100 --> 00:32:52,500
(Bites lip)

1114
00:32:52,520 --> 00:32:53,360
This is torture.

1115
00:32:58,120 --> 00:32:59,000
So agonizing.

1116
00:33:05,380 --> 00:33:06,540
(Gets up)

1117
00:33:07,480 --> 00:33:08,880
You guys haven't taken

1118
00:33:08,880 --> 00:33:09,800
my flowers yet.

1119
00:33:09,800 --> 00:33:11,640
You haven't taken the flowers.

1120
00:33:11,900 --> 00:33:13,380
(Didn't hear)

1121
00:33:13,840 --> 00:33:14,520
Your flowers.

1122
00:33:14,520 --> 00:33:15,880
(Walks over)
I'm giving out flowers.

1123
00:33:15,880 --> 00:33:16,600
First come, first served.

1124
00:33:16,600 --> 00:33:17,520
One each.

1125
00:33:17,520 --> 00:33:18,420
(Hands over)

1126
00:33:18,760 --> 00:33:19,720
This is a tulip.

1127
00:33:21,720 --> 00:33:22,840
This is a Children's Day special.

1128
00:33:22,840 --> 00:33:23,600
There won't be any tomorrow.

1129
00:33:24,120 --> 00:33:25,240
Thanks.

1130
00:33:26,480 --> 00:33:27,520
Why did you pick

1131
00:33:27,520 --> 00:33:28,420
(Studies)
this one?

1132
00:33:29,200 --> 00:33:29,880
What kind of flower is this?

1133
00:33:29,880 --> 00:33:30,480
It's fake.

1134
00:33:35,040 --> 00:33:36,120
I'll take the one that's about to bloom.

1135
00:33:42,720 --> 00:33:43,240
Looks good.

1136
00:33:45,400 --> 00:33:46,600
I got everyone flowers

1137
00:33:46,600 --> 00:33:48,800
so I could give you one.

1138
00:33:49,280 --> 00:33:50,640
After they came back

1139
00:33:50,640 --> 00:33:51,480
from the stargazing room,

1140
00:33:51,480 --> 00:33:52,520
you could still tell

1141
00:33:52,520 --> 00:33:54,160
how everyone was feeling

1142
00:33:54,160 --> 00:33:54,760
overall.

1143
00:33:55,560 --> 00:33:56,280
I think Zhao Xilun

1144
00:33:56,280 --> 00:33:57,080
is great.

1145
00:33:57,080 --> 00:33:58,000
He says

1146
00:33:58,000 --> 00:33:58,800
whatever's on his mind.

1147
00:33:58,800 --> 00:33:59,840
Meng, on the other hand,

1148
00:33:59,840 --> 00:34:01,280
always pays attention

1149
00:34:01,280 --> 00:34:02,840
(Meng keeps an eye on Zhao Xilun)
to how Xilun is doing.

1150
00:34:02,840 --> 00:34:04,200
She clearly knows

1151
00:34:04,200 --> 00:34:04,960
that Zhao Xilun

1152
00:34:04,960 --> 00:34:06,080
is feeling a little

1153
00:34:06,640 --> 00:34:07,520
different

1154
00:34:07,520 --> 00:34:08,320
right now.

1155
00:34:08,320 --> 00:34:08,560
Yeah.

1156
00:34:08,560 --> 00:34:09,720
The vibe has shifted a little.

1157
00:34:09,720 --> 00:34:10,200
Yeah.

1158
00:34:10,200 --> 00:34:11,400
She was the first to show up

1159
00:34:11,720 --> 00:34:12,760
with flowers for everyone.

1160
00:34:12,760 --> 00:34:13,880
She didn't want him to feel pressured.

1161
00:34:13,880 --> 00:34:14,160
Yeah.

1162
00:34:14,160 --> 00:34:15,440
I wanted to buy you flowers,

1163
00:34:15,440 --> 00:34:16,280
but everyone got some.

1164
00:34:16,280 --> 00:34:16,640
Yeah.

1165
00:34:16,640 --> 00:34:18,160
It felt very natural and thoughtful.

1166
00:34:18,160 --> 00:34:19,200
I also think

1167
00:34:19,200 --> 00:34:20,600
Liang Renfang and Yu Yang

1168
00:34:20,600 --> 00:34:22,040
(Liang Renfang, Yu Yang)
felt so natural together

1169
00:34:22,040 --> 00:34:23,920
(Comfortable)
while rowing.

1170
00:34:23,920 --> 00:34:24,800
The two of them...

1171
00:34:24,800 --> 00:34:25,760
Felt like they were about

1172
00:34:25,760 --> 00:34:26,040
to get married.

1173
00:34:27,240 --> 00:34:28,320
I really like them.

1174
00:34:28,320 --> 00:34:29,120
I've always liked them.

1175
00:34:29,120 --> 00:34:29,760
Ever since their

1176
00:34:29,760 --> 00:34:31,440
first episode,

1177
00:34:31,440 --> 00:34:31,960
remember when

1178
00:34:31,960 --> 00:34:32,880
the guy picked up the camera

1179
